WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Safety and jurisdiction. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Find the authority before claiming compliance

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Vehicle rules depend on activity and jurisdiction. Identify the relevant authority and current official source before making a compliance claim.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Separate classroom calculation, engineering verification and legal certification; they are not interchangeable.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Source-path exercise

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Find the authority before claiming compliance
